[8] What is the difference between writeFile and appendFile methods?

(a) writeFile()

1. Creates a new file.
2. Overwrites existing content.
3. Removes old data.

(b) appendFile()

1. Adds data at the end of file.
2. Keeps existing content.
3. Does not delete old data.

